      528        B-2 AT ROW 2.96 COL 3 WIDGET-ID 96
      529        contr-in-income-NP AT ROW 2.96 COL 5.88 WIDGET-ID 44
      530        B-3 AT ROW 3.96 COL 3 WIDGET-ID 124
      531        contr-in-income-CPT AT ROW 3.96 COL 5.88 WIDGET-ID 126
      532        B-4 AT ROW 4.96 COL 3 WIDGET-ID 98
      533        contr-in-expense-NP AT ROW 4.96 COL 5.88 WIDGET-ID 46
      534        B-5 AT ROW 5.96 COL 3 WIDGET-ID 116
      535        contr-in-expense-CPT AT ROW 5.96 COL 5.88 WIDGET-ID 118
      536        B-6 AT ROW 6.96 COL 3 WIDGET-ID 100
