      538        B-7 AT ROW 7.96 COL 3 WIDGET-ID 108
      539        contr-recount AT ROW 7.96 COL 5.88 WIDGET-ID 110
      540        v-contr-in-income-NP AT ROW 2.96 COL 6.75 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 6
      541        v-contr-in-income-CPT AT ROW 3.96 COL 6.75 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 130
      542        v-contr-in-expense-NP AT ROW 4.96 COL 6.75 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 18
      543        v-contr-in-expense-CPT AT ROW 5.96 COL 6.75 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 122
      544        v-contr-qnty-spec AT ROW 6.96 COL 6.75 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 106
      545        v-contr-recount AT ROW 7.96 COL 6.75 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 114
